<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/30/msa@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Perenggan 10b(3)(c) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan sebelum perkataan “an appeal” perkataan “a review or”. Penggantian seksyen 106b"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/30/msa@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/30/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/30/msa@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/30/msa@> .
