<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/30/msa@/~cl_6__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan menggantikan perenggan (c) dengan perenggan yang berikut: “(c) counterfeits or causes to be counterfeited or falsifies or causes to be falsified any document which is or may be required under this Act or used in the transaction of any business or matter relating to customs, or uses or causes to be used or in any way assists in the use of such counterfeited or falsified document;”;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/30/msa@> .
